sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant API
    participant DB as Database
    User->>+API: Submit request
    Note over API,DB: Validate and persist
    loop Retry on conflict
        API->>+DB: Save record
        DB-->>-API: Result
        API->>API: Check result
    end
    alt Saved
        API-->>User: Confirmation
    else Rejected
        API--xUser: Validation error
    end
    deactivate API
